#. metadata.json->name
msgid "Rates and Metals"
msgstr "Kurse und Edelmetalle"

#. metadata.json->description
msgid ""
"Exchange rates (ECB) and precious metal prices as a list - choose in the "
"settings what is shown."
msgstr ""
"Wechselkurse (EZB) und Edelmetallpreise als Liste – in den Einstellungen "
"wählbar, was angezeigt wird."

